        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Let's use prednisolone, 40 milligrams, once now, single dose. You take it by mouth. It's for asthma attack. Sit upright and take slow breaths while the nebuliser is set up. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest. Come back straight away. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?",
